From: Jiajin Cui <cuijiajin@uniontech.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Prevent null pointer dereference in directory scanning.

Backported from WineHQ commit 74272424dc (wine-11.1) without code
changes.

get_cached_dir_data() could reset the position of a cache entry that was
never allocated.

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c
@@ -2845,7 +2845,7 @@
     }
 
     *data_ret = dir_data_cache[entry];
-    if (restart_scan) (*data_ret)->pos = 0;
+    if (restart_scan && *data_ret) (*data_ret)->pos = 0;
     return status;
 }
 
